    <bpmn:process id="W_W2002" name="W2002. Retail Media Booking &amp; Reservation System Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor or Account Manager books media placement
Frequency: ~50–100 bookings/month
Volume: ~3,070–3,080 total media positions (in-store + ecommerce + print)
Owner: Marketing Manager
Participants: Marketing Manager, Account Manager, Vendor
Source: workflow W2002 — Retail Media Booking &amp; Reservation System Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2002_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2002_Lane1" name="Account Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2002_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2002_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2002_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2002_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2002_Lane3" name="Marketing Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2002_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2002_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2002_Start5" name="Vendor or Account Manager books media placement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2002_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2002_Task6" name="Account Manager creates booking: (a) select media type and specific placement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Account Manager creates booking: (a) select media type and specific placement, (b) select store list (all 200, regional, specific stores), (c) select duration (1 week, 2 weeks, 1 month, per catalog edition), (d) system checks availability: is placement already booked for requested period?, (e) if available: reserve placement, (f) if unavailable: offer alternatives (different store, different dates, different placement type)
Responsible (R): Account Manager
Accountable (A): Marketing Manager
Duration: 15–30 min/booking</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2002_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2002_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W2002_Task7" name="Booking confirmation: (a) system generates booking confirmation with: placement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Booking confirmation: (a) system generates booking confirmation with: placement details, rate, duration, total cost, creative submission deadline, installation timeline, (b) send to vendor for approval, (c) vendor approves (or requests changes), (d) booking locked — placement reserved
Responsible (R): System / Account Manager
Accountable (A): Marketing Manager
Duration: Per booking</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2002_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2002_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2002_Task8" name="Booking calendar management: (a) monthly view of all placements by store and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Booking calendar management: (a) monthly view of all placements by store and media type, (b) identify unbooked inventory for promotional pricing or internal use, (c) overbooking prevention: system blocks double-booking of same placement
Responsible (R): Marketing Manager
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 1–2 hours/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2002_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2002_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2002_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2002_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2002_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-385 (ensure controlled execution — Retail Media Platform &amp; Inventory Management (PA-48.1).) | - operational: Marketing Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Marketing Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W2002_Assoc11" sourceRef="W2002_Annotation10" targetRef="W2002_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
